Error [E1101]: `count` is a mutable value — the new task might outlive this scope
  --> tests/ui/data_race_taskgroup_mutable_capture.jet:4:28
    |
  4 |         task :: group.task(() => {
    |                            ^^^^^^^
 Why: tasks run concurrently; a `var` binding can't be shared between tasks
 Fix: give the task its own copy (`~count`) or hand it over with `take(count)`
